    "Review actions are unavailable. Try again later.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"sw":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vitendo vya marudio havipatikani. Jaribu tena baadaye."}},"ta":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"மீள்பயிற்சி செயல்கள் கிடைக்கவில்லை. பின்னர் மீண்டும் முயலவும்."}},"te":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"పునశ్చరణ చర్యలు అందుబాటులో లేవు. తర్వాత మళ్లీ ప్రయత్నించండి."}},"sk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Akcie opakovania nie sú dostupné. Skúste to znova neskôr."}},"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dejanja ponavljanja niso na voljo. Poskusite znova pozneje."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repetitionsåtgärder är inte tillgängliga. Försök igen senare."}},"pa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ਦੁਹਰਾਈ ਦੀਆਂ ਕਾਰਵਾਈਆਂ ਉਪਲਬਧ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ। ਬਾਅਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਮੁੜ ਕੋਸ਼ਿਸ਼ ਕਰੋ।"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Działania powtórek są niedostępne. Spróbuj ponownie później."}},"ro":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Acțiunile de recapitulare nu sunt disponibile. Încearcă din nou mai târziu."}},"mr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"उजळणीच्या कृती उपलब्ध नाहीत. नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repetisjonshandlinger er utilgjengelige. Prøv igjen senere."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Herhaalacties zijn niet beschikbaar. Probeer het later opnieuw."}},"lt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kartojimo veiksmai nepasiekiami. Bandykite vėliau."}},"lv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Atkārtošanas darbības nav pieejamas. Mēģiniet vēlāk."}},"ml":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ആവർത്തന പ്രവർത്തനങ്ങൾ ലഭ്യമല്ല. പിന്നീട് ശ്രമിക്കുക."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le azioni di ripasso non sono disponibili. Riprova più tardi."}},"kn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಗಳು ಲಭ್ಯವಿಲ್ಲ. ನಂತರ ಮತ್ತೆ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಿ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"복습 동작을 사용할 수 없습니다. 나중에 다시 시도하세요."}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az ismétlési műveletek nem érhetők el. Próbáld újra később."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tindakan pengulangan tidak tersedia. Coba lagi nanti."}},"is":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Upprifjunaraðgerðir eru ekki tiltækar. Reyndu aftur síðar."}},"gu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"પુનરાવર્તનની ક્રિયાઓ ઉપલબ્ધ નથી. પછી ફરી પ્રયાસ કરો."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"פעולות החזרה אינן זמינות. יש לנסות שוב מאוחר יותר."}},"hr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Radnje ponavljanja nisu dostupne. Pokušajte ponovno kasnije."}},"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kordamistoimingud pole saadaval. Proovi hiljem uuesti."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اقدام‌های مرور در دسترس نیستند. بعداً دوباره امتحان کنید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kertaustoiminnot eivät ole käytettävissä. Yritä myöhemmin uudelleen."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Akce opakování nejsou dostupné. Zkuste to později."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repetitionshandlinger er ikke tilgængelige. Prøv igen senere."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Οι ενέργειες επανάληψης δεν είναι διαθέσιμες. Δοκιμάστε ξανά αργότερα."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Действията за преговор не са налични. Опитайте отново по-късно."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"পুনরালোচনা কর্ম অনুপলব্ধ। পরে আবার চেষ্টা করুন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les accions de repàs no estan disponibles. Torna-ho a provar més tard."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review actions are unavailable. Try again later."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إجراءات المراجعة غير متاحة. حاول مرة أخرى لاحقًا."}},"zh-Hans":{"st