    "You haven't created any cards yet.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"sw":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bado hujaunda kadi zozote."}},"ta":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"நீங்கள் இன்னும் அட்டைகளை உருவாக்கவில்லை."}},"te":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"మీరు ఇంకా కార్డులను సృష్టించలేదు."}},"sk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatiaľ ste nevytvorili žiadne karty."}},"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ustvarili niste še nobene kartice."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har inte skapat några kort än."}},"pa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹਾਲੇ ਕੋਈ ਕਾਰਡ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਾਇਆ।"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nie masz jeszcze utworzonych fiszek."}},"ro":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Încă nu ai creat nicio fișă."}},"mr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"तुम्ही अद्याप कोणतीही कार्डे तयार केलेली नाहीत."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har ikke opprettet noen kort ennå."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je hebt nog geen kaarten gemaakt."}},"lt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dar nesukūrėte nė vienos kortelės."}},"lv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jūs vēl neesat izveidojis nevienu kartīti."}},"ml":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"നിങ്ങൾ ഇതുവരെ കാർഡുകളൊന്നും സൃഷ്ടിച്ചിട്ടില്ല."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non hai ancora creato schede."}},"kn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ನೀವು ಇನ್ನೂ ಕಾರ್ಡ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ರಚಿಸಿಲ್ಲ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 만든 카드가 없습니다."}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Még nem hoztál létre kártyát."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anda belum membuat kartu."}},"is":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Þú hefur ekki búið til nein spjöld enn."}},"gu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"તમે હજી કોઈ કાર્ડ બનાવ્યું નથી."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"עדיין לא יצרת כרטיסיות."}},"hr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Još niste stvorili nijednu karticu."}},"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sa pole veel ühtegi kaarti loonud."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنوز هیچ کارتی نساخته‌اید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Et ole vielä luonut kortteja."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatím jste nevytvořili žádné kartičky."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har ikke oprettet nogen kort endnu."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Δεν έχετε δημιουργήσει κάρτες ακόμα."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все още не сте създали никакви карти."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"আপনি এখনও কোনো কার্ড তৈরি করেননি।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encara no has creat cap targeta."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You haven't created any cards yet."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لم تنشئ أي بطاقات بعد."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你还没有创建任何卡片。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du hast noch keine Karten erstellt."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous n’avez pas encore créé de cartes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपने अभी तक कोई कार्ड नहीं बनाया है।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まだカードを作成していません。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você ainda não criou nenhum cartão."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вы еще не создали ни одной карточки."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta."}}}},
    "You haven't created any cards yet. Add your first card to start studying.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"sw":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bado hujaunda kadi zozote. Ongeza kadi yako ya kwanza ili uanze kujifunza."}},"ta":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"நீங்கள் இன்னும் அட்டைகளை உருவாக்கவில்லை. படிக்கத் தொடங்க முதல் அட்டையைச் சேர்க்கவும்."}},"te":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"మీరు ఇంకా కార్డులను సృష్టించలేదు. చదవడం ప్రారంభించడానికి మీ మొదటి కార్డును చేర్చండి."}},"sk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatiaľ ste nevytvorili žiadne karty. Pridajte prvú kartu a začnite sa učiť."}},"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ustvarili niste še nobene kartice. Dodajte prvo kartico in začnite z učenjem."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har inte skapat några kort än. Lägg till ditt första kort för att börja studera."}},"pa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹਾਲੇ ਕੋਈ ਕਾਰਡ ਨਹੀਂ ਬਣਾਇਆ। ਪੜ੍ਹਾਈ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਆਪਣਾ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਾਰਡ ਸ਼ਾਮਲ ਕਰੋ।"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nie masz jeszcze utworzonych fiszek. Dodaj pierwszą, aby zacząć naukę."}},"ro":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Încă nu ai creat nicio fișă. Adaugă prima fișă pentru a începe să studiezi."}},"mr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"तुम्ही अद्याप कोणतीही कार्डे तयार केलेली नाहीत. अभ्यास सुरू करण्यासाठी तुमचे पहिले कार्ड जोडा."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har ikke opprettet noen kort ennå. Legg til ditt første kort for å begynne å studere."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je hebt nog geen kaarten gemaakt. Voeg je eerste kaart toe om te beginnen met studeren."}},"lt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dar nesukūrėte nė vienos kortelės. Pridėkite pirmąją, kad pradėtumėte mokytis."}},"lv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jūs vēl neesat izveidojis nevienu kartīti. Pievienojiet pirmo kartīti, lai sāktu mācīties."}},"ml":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"നിങ്ങൾ ഇതുവരെ കാർഡുകളൊന്നും സൃഷ്ടിച്ചിട്ടില്ല. പഠനം തുടങ്ങാൻ ആദ്യ കാർഡ് ചേർക്കുക."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non hai ancora creato schede. Aggiungi la prima per iniziare a studiare."}},"kn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ನೀವು ಇನ್ನೂ ಕಾರ್ಡ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ರಚಿಸಿಲ್ಲ. ಅಧ್ಯಯನ ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಲು ಮೊದಲ ಕಾರ್ಡ್ ಸೇರಿಸಿ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 만든 카드가 없습니다. 첫 카드를 추가하고 학습을 시작하세요."}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Még nem hoztál létre kártyát. Adj hozzá egyet a tanulás elkezdéséhez."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anda belum membuat kartu. Tambahkan kartu pertama untuk mulai belajar."}},"is":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Þú hefur ekki búið til nein spjöld enn. Bættu við fyrsta spjaldinu til að byrja að læra."}},"gu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"તમે હજી કોઈ કાર્ડ બનાવ્યું નથી. અભ્યાસ શરૂ કરવા તમારું પહેલું કાર્ડ ઉમેરો."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"עדיין לא יצרת כרטיסיות. אפשר להוסיף את הכרטיסייה הראשונה ולהתחיל ללמוד."}},"hr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Još niste stvorili nijednu karticu. Dodajte prvu karticu da biste počeli učiti."}},"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sa pole veel ühtegi kaarti loonud. Õppimise alustamiseks lisa oma esimene kaart."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنوز هیچ کارتی نساخته‌اید. برای شروع مطالعه، اولین کارت خود را اضافه کنید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Et ole vielä luonut kortteja. Aloita opiskelu lisäämällä ensimmäinen korttisi."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatím jste nevytvořili žádné kartičky. Přidejte první kartičku a začněte se učit."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du har ikke oprettet nogen kort endnu. Tilføj dit første kort for at begynde at lære."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Δεν έχετε δημιουργήσει κάρτες ακόμα. Προσθέστε την πρώτη σας κάρτα για να αρχίσετε τη μελέτη."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Все още не сте създали никакви карти. Добавете първата си карта, за да започнете да учите."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"আপনি এখনও কোনো কার্ড তৈরি করেননি। পড়াশোনা শুরু করতে আপনার প্রথম কার্ড যোগ করুন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encara no has creat cap targeta. Afegeix la teva primera targeta per començar a estudiar."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You haven't created any cards yet. Add your first card to start studying."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لم تنشئ أي بطاقات بعد. أضف بطاقتك الأولى لبدء الدراسة."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你还没有创建任何卡片。添加第一张卡片即可开始学习。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du hast noch keine Karten erstellt. Füge deine erste Karte hinzu, um mit dem Lernen zu beginnen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous n’avez pas encore créé de cartes. Ajoutez votre première carte pour commencer à étudier."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपने अभी तक कोई कार्ड नहीं बनाया है। पढ़ाई शुरू करने के लिए अपना पहला कार्ड जोड़ें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まだカードを作成していません。最初のカードを追加して学習を始めましょう。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você ainda não criou nenhum cartão. Adicione seu primeiro cartão para começar a estudar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вы еще не создали ни одной карточки. Добавьте первую карточку, чтобы начать учиться."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta. Agrega tu primera tarjeta para empezar a estudiar."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta. Añade tu primera tarjeta para empezar a estudiar."}}}},
    "You're all caught up for now. Come back later or add more cards.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"sw":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Umemaliza yote kwa sasa. Rudi baadaye au ongeza kadi zaidi."}},"ta":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"இப்போதைக்கு அனைத்தையும் முடித்துவிட்டீர்கள். பின்னர் திரும்பி வாருங்கள் அல்லது மேலும் அட்டைகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்."}},"te":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ప్రస్తుతానికి అన్నీ పూర్తయ్యాయి. తర్వాత మళ్లీ రండి లేదా మరిన్ని కార్డులను చేర్చండి."}},"sk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na teraz máte všetko zopakované. Vráťte sa neskôr alebo pridajte ďalšie karty."}},"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Za zdaj ste vse ponovili. Vrnite se pozneje ali dodajte več kartic."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du är klar för tillfället. Kom tillbaka senare eller lägg till fler kort."}},"pa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ਫ਼ਿਲਹਾਲ ਸਭ ਮੁਕੰਮਲ ਹੈ। ਬਾਅਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਵਾਪਸ ਆਓ ਜਾਂ ਹੋਰ ਕਾਰਡ ਸ਼ਾਮਲ ਕਰੋ।"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na razie wszystko zrobione. Wróć później lub dodaj więcej fiszek."}},"ro":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deocamdată ești la zi. Revino mai târziu sau adaugă mai multe fișe."}},"mr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सध्याची सर्व उजळणी पूर्ण झाली. नंतर परत या किंवा आणखी कार्डे जोडा."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du er ajour foreløpig. Kom tilbake senere eller legg til flere kort."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je bent voorlopig helemaal bij. Kom later terug of voeg meer kaarten toe."}},"lt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kol kas viską pakartojote. Grįžkite vėliau arba pridėkite daugiau kortelių."}},"lv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pagaidām viss ir atkārtots. Atgriezieties vēlāk vai pievienojiet vēl kartītes."}},"ml":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ഇപ്പോൾ എല്ലാം പൂർത്തിയായി. പിന്നീട് വരിക അല്ലെങ്കിൽ കൂടുതൽ കാർഡുകൾ ചേർക്കുക."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Per ora hai finito tutti i ripassi. Torna più tardi o aggiungi altre schede."}},"kn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ಈಗಕ್ಕೆ ಎಲ್ಲ ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆಗಳು ಮುಗಿದಿವೆ. ನಂತರ ಬನ್ನಿ ಅಥವಾ ಇನ್ನಷ್ಟು ಕಾರ್ಡ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ಸೇರಿಸಿ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"지금 할 복습을 모두 마쳤습니다. 나중에 다시 오거나 카드를 더 추가하세요."}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Most mindennel végeztél. Nézz vissza később, vagy adj hozzá új kártyákat."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semua sudah selesai untuk saat ini. Kembali nanti atau tambahkan kartu lagi."}},"is":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Þú ert búin(n) með allt í bili. Komdu aftur síðar eða bættu við fleiri spjöldum."}},"gu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"હમણાં માટે બધું પૂર્ણ થયું છે. પછી પાછા આવો અથવા વધુ કાર્ડ ઉમેરો."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"כרגע הכול הושלם. אפשר לחזור מאוחר יותר או להוסיף כרטיסיות."}},"hr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zasad ste sve ponovili. Vratite se kasnije ili dodajte još kartica."}},"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Praeguseks on kõik korratud. Tule hiljem tagasi või lisa kaarte."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فعلاً همه‌چیز مرور شده است. بعداً برگردید یا کارت‌های بیشتری اضافه کنید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kaikki on toistaiseksi kerrattu. Palaa myöhemmin tai lisää kortteja."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prozatím máte vše hotovo. Vraťte se později nebo přidejte další kartičky."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du er ajour for nu. Kom tilbage senere, eller tilføj flere kort."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Προς το παρόν τα ολοκληρώσατε όλα. Επιστρέψτε αργότερα ή προσθέστε περισσότερες κάρτες."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всички карти за момента са преговорени. Върнете се по-късно или добавете още карти."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"এখনকার সব কার্ডের পুনরালোচনা শেষ। পরে ফিরে আসুন বা আরও কার্ড যোগ করুন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"De moment ja ho tens tot al dia. Torna més tard o afegeix més targetes."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You're all caught up for now. Come back later or add more cards."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لقد أنهيت كل ما عليك حاليًا. عُد لاحقًا أو أضف المزيد من البطاقات."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你目前已经全部复习完了。稍后再来，或添加更多卡片。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du bist fürs Erste fertig. Komm später wieder oder füge weitere Karten hinzu."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous êtes à jour pour le moment. Revenez plus tard ou ajoutez d’autres cartes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"फिलहाल आपने सब पूरा कर लिया है। बाद में वापस आएं या और कार्ड जोड़ें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今のところ、復習はすべて完了しています。後で戻るか、カードを追加してください。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você está em dia por enquanto. Volte mais tarde ou adicione mais cartões."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сейчас вы все повторили. Вернитесь позже или добавьте еще карточки."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora ya estás al día. Vuelve más tarde o agrega más tarjetas."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora ya estás al día. Vuelve más tarde o añade más tarjetas."}}}},
